            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Boy? This is a pleasant surprise; I thought you were with your uncle, guarding Fort Garard. Come to celebrate the war’s end with us, did you? It is good to see you again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Garard",
            x: 28,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Delfador",
            x: 27,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Hold on, what’s the matter with— you’re <b><i>injured</i></b>!? What happened! Where’s that useless Methor when you need him?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("<span size='small'>_It’s about your—</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("...Father, it’s Uncle. Prince Arand."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("He’s found the Sceptre of Fire. He declared his claim to the throne, and seized control of Fort Garard. My bodyguards and I tried to stop him, but we didn’t even get close. I barely made it out alive."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Arand tried to kill me, Father. He’s coming for you next."),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "fade_duration_remaining",
            value: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "while",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "condition",
                variable: "fade_duration_remaining",
                greater_than: 0,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "fade_duration_remaining",
                value: 5,
                mode: "sub",
              },
              {
                tag: "set_variable",
                name: "volume",
                value: 100,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "volume",
                value: "$fade_duration_remaining",
                mode: "multiply",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "volume",
                value: 1000,
                mode: "divide",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:volume",
                music: "$volume",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:delay",
                time: 5,
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:volume",
            music: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "silence.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Garard—?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("<b><i>_WHAT!?</i></b>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "fade_duration_remaining",
            value: 100,
          },
          {
            tag: "while",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "condition",
                variable: "fade_duration_remaining",
                greater_than: 0,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "fade_duration_remaining",
                value: 5,
                mode: "sub",
              },
              {
                tag: "set_variable",
                name: "volume",
                value: 100,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "volume",
                value: "$fade_duration_remaining",
                mode: "multiply",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "volume",
                value: 100,
                mode: "divide",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "volume",
                value: "$(100-$volume)",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:volume",
                music: "$volume",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:delay",
                time: 5,
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:volume",
            music: 100,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "frantic.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("That TREASONOUS son-of-a, son-of— I knew something felt suspicious lately."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("It all makes sense now. Arand is my spymaster — of course the spies told me nothing. And Arand warned me that others were searching for the Sceptre... to trick me into sending away Lionel, my most loyal general!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Garard",
            x: 27,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("How DARE he threaten me? How dare he lay a FINGER on my son? I’ll see him hang for this."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Delfador, take command of the cavalry; my personal royal cavalry — they’re the only ones I still trust. Ride to Fort Garard and burn it to the ground!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("I want every one of those traitors dead! Return with Arand’s head— his HEAD! Or don’t return at all. Do you understand!?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Yes, Your Majesty!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Delfador",
            x: 23,
            y: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Garard",
            x: 30,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Deoran",
            unit: "Deoran",
            x: 25,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Deoran",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "nw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "se",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Delfador, I couldn’t help but overhear. Prince Arand, the king’s brother?? That can’t be."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("The young Prince Eldred’s wounds are clear as day, Deoran. Will you ride with us? Every moment we delay is another chance for Arand to rally more rebels to his cause."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("But a sentence of death, without even trial? Arand is thoughtful and quiet, and not known to be ambitious."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("The king has commanded his death, yes. But you are the one sent to carry it out. You don’t... <b><i>have</i></b> to go, you know. At least not so hastily."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Refuse Garard’s order. Hold back, dispatch scouts, and gather more information before committing so much of the army to this attack. Wesnoth can scant afford a civil war, and certainly not so soon after the orcs!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Are you mad?! It’s neither your place nor mine to second-guess His Majesty. Especially not now, when he needs loyalty more than ever."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Delfador, I really worry—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("And... besides, I’ve lived half my life fighting alongside the king, fighting to gain his favor. Today I’m “The Great”, but I didn’t even have a name before I first began to battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Without that, who am I? I don’t want to end up exiled, like you were..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Delfador",
            x: 20,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
